  "answer_text": "Yes — MFA can be reset for a user. To reset MFA for Mark: 1) In the CMA nav, go to Access > Users. 2) In the User list, check the box next to his name. 3) From Actions, select Reset MFA. 4) In the confirmation window, click OK. 5) He will receive an email with a link to the Cato User Portal; after signing in, he will need to configure MFA again.",
